    <string name="exam_placed">Told the codex right %1$d times of %2$d</string>
    <string name="exam_verdict_high">The abbot nods. What you have learned holds together and you can find it from any side.</string>
    <string name="exam_verdict_mid">The abbot is content, but not entirely. The pages you missed will come up in your restorations sooner now.</string>
    <string name="exam_verdict_low">The abbot is stern but fair: mixing everything up is hard, and that is why it teaches. The missed pages are moved closer.</string>
    <string name="exam_desk_first">Questions from every codex, all mixed together. Once a month.</string>
